{
  "name": "@engine/shop",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Old East Indies' own app (PLAN-V2 §3, DR-17): the shop's Next.js 16 app with Payload embedded from @engine/cms-shop, on its own database (indies_shop), serving the shop's hosts only. Its admin mount is TASKS.md 23.1's; its proxy and shell 23.2's, its pages 23.3's, its engine routes and chat 23.4's.",
